  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "OnPointerEnter and OnPointerExit are two events that the UI Event System supports. These two events allow you to do things when the pointer mouses over or mouses off a UI element. For example, when hovering over a button, it allows you to pop up some helper text to tell the user what the button does.\nThis doesn't work in VRChat. Either the functionality is stripped out before upload, or the events themselves do nothing when triggered, or they cannot be triggered at all.\n\nNote that these are the two obviously useful events in the Event System, but it looks like the others do not work either.",
